      "description": "Jump Cat for Watch is a minimalist arcade game designed exclusively for Apple Watch. Tap and hold the screen to control your jump distance and land perfectly on the next platform. It is the perfect time-killer for commuting or waiting in line. Enjoy smooth gameplay right on your wrist, even without an internet connection. Challenge your reflexes and aim for the highest score.",
